<main><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="crumbs">CRANIO / Education</div><h1>Education</h1><p class="lead">Learn to describe experience, record context, compare states and distinguish observation from interpretation. Professional training and certification are planned pathways; course enrollment is not available on this site yet.</p><section class="section"><h2>Continue exploring</h2><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="../experience/"><h3>For You</h3><p>Your experience</p></a><a class="card" href="../method/"><h3>Method</h3><p>Observe → Calibrate → Identify → Optimize → Verify</p></a><a class="card" href="../explore/"><h3>Explore</h3><p>Choose how deep to go</p></a></div></section><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../start/">Start</a></div></article></div></main>